AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,
OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE
SOFTWARE.

The mascot images (CE/icon/popgba_mascot.bmp and
.github/images/popgba_mascot_C_osanpo_4x.png) and the app icon
(CE/icon/popgba.ico) are not covered by this MIT license: they are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

The font data (CE/ce_shinonome16.h, CE/ce_galmuri14.h,
CE/ce_galmuri11.h) is not covered by this MIT license either; see
CE/THIRDPARTY_LICENSES.txt.

3. The gpSP license notice
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The following notice is the one at the top of gpSP's main.c; some of
the other core sources carry no notice of their own (see section 1).
No game ROMs, no Nintendo GBA BIOS and no other Nintendo copyrighted
material are included in or required by this repository.

